  "notes": [
    "Fix: dropped the clerks' evening regular tie to servers. No clerk variant makes an evening square stop, so 13 clerks failed. Clerks reach the café by the square meal only; their ties are workmate and family.",
    "Guard variant guard-cafe-square (café before the shift, square after) serves the door guard's pre-shift and evening ties and the lover pattern.",
    "Guard: posts door 1 and official 1, the rest inside on the official side; watch count 2. Councillor and driver count 1 each, by car.",
    "Over half the guards hold a pre-shift regular tie to the café's servers (share 0.7 plus the door guard's).",
    "Server debt weight 70 (servers only) so the chime server likely carries debt [S]. Question for Motive: should it be 100?",
    "Driver cash weight 70, workmate tie to the councillor at share 1. A fearful driver cannot draw cash, so the driver is idealist, loyal or mercenary.",
    "Starting values [S]: record shares 0.1-0.12, family and workmate shares, resident mix 25% each. Names: 8 origins at 12.5% each."
